WEBVTT

00:23:27.402 --> 00:23:31.656
to have you, such a wonderful
and compelling storyteller,

00:23:31.656 --> 00:23:34.659
to shine a light on this issue

00:23:34.659 --> 00:23:38.371
and educate us all
so that we can stand in solidarity.

00:23:38.413 --> 00:23:39.664
So thank you.

00:23:39.706 --> 00:23:42.125
It's been wonderful
listening to you today.

00:23:42.167 --> 00:23:43.418
Thank you, Tamana.

00:23:43.460 --> 00:23:44.711
TA: Thank you.